{
  "workflowId": "100002240709086",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_SERVICE_REQUEST_INGESTION_ASSISTANT_1",
  "name": "Service Requests Ingestion Assistant",
  "description": "Service Request Ingestion Assistant is responsible for retrieving resolved requests, validating their accuracy, and ingesting them into the RAG system",
  "specification": {
    "jsonSchemaName": "Workflow.spec",
    "jsonSchemaVersion": "1",
    "inputs": [],
    "outputSpecification": " ",
    "agentsValueMappings": [],
    "dataPipeline": {
      "pipelineNodes": [
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Start of data pipeline",
            "name": "Start"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775457325574"
          },
          "code": "START",
          "id": "start",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "START"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "verify whether the ingestion process is a single ingestion or a multi-ingestion.",
            "name": "check Ingestion Mode"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "bulk": "1775110539582",
            "single": "1775458246067"
          },
          "code": "CHECK_INGESTION_MODE",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1775457325574",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775457325574_caseExpression",
              "name": "caseExpression",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.srNumber && $context.$triggers.REST.$input.srNumber.trim() !== \"\" ? \"single\" : \"bulk\"}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SWITCH"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Validates that a bulk ingestion query was provided in the REST trigger input.",
            "name": "Validate Ingestion Query"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "true": "1776022419150",
            "false": "1776066136960"
          },
          "code": "VALIDATE_INGESTION_QUERY",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1775110539582",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775110539583_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.query != \"null\" && $context.$triggers.REST.$input.query != \"\"}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_CX_SERVICECEN_RETRIEVERESOLVE",
            "description": "Retrieves a single resolved Service Request by SR number for ingestion.",
            "errorNodeId": "1775804058600",
            "functionName": "getSR",
            "name": "Retrieve Resolved SR"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775458382742"
          },
          "code": "RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SR",
          "id": "1775458246067",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775458246067_ObjectType",
              "name": "ObjectType",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.objectType}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "1775458246067_SrNumber",
              "name": "SrNumber",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.srNumber}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"ResolveDescription\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"ProblemDescription\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"Title\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"SrNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Sets the fetch size (page limit) used when retrieving resolved SRs for bulk ingestion.",
            "name": "Set Fetch Size"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775110750542"
          },
          "code": "SET_FETCH_SIZE",
          "id": "1776022419150",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776022419150_fetchSize",
              "name": "fetchSize",
              "value": "100"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Format Error Message",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let errorMsg =\n  \"Ingestion failed. Please verify the provided values and try again.\";\n\ntry {\n  const query = $context?.$triggers?.REST?.$input?.query;\n  const queryStr = typeof query === \"string\" ? query.trim() : \"\";\n\n  if (!queryStr) {\n    errorMsg =\n      \"Missing required input: `query`. Please provide a non-empty query value.\";\n  } else if ($context?.$nodes?.FETCH_RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SRS?.$error?.$info) {\n    const info = $context.$nodes.FETCH_RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SRS.$error.$info;\n    let detail = \"\";\n\n    try {\n      const parsed = JSON.parse(info);\n      detail =\n        (typeof parsed?.[\"o:errorDetails\"]?.[0]?.detail === \"string\" &&\n          parsed[\"o:errorDetails\"][0].detail.trim()) ||\n        (typeof parsed?.error?.details?.[0]?.detail === \"string\" &&\n          parsed.error.details[0].detail.trim()) ||\n        (typeof parsed?.message === \"string\" && parsed.message.trim()) ||\n        \"\";\n    } catch {\n      detail = \"\";\n    }\n\n    errorMsg =\n      detail || \"Invalid query. Please check the `query` value and try again.\";\n  } else if ($context?.$nodes?.INGEST_SR?.$error?.$info) {\n    const info = $context.$nodes.INGEST_SR.$error.$info;\n    let detail = \"\";\n\n    try {\n      const parsed = JSON.parse(info);\n      detail =\n        (typeof parsed?.details?.[0]?.detail === \"string\" &&\n          parsed.details[0].detail.trim()) ||\n        (typeof parsed?.error?.details?.[0]?.detail === \"string\" &&\n          parsed.error.details[0].detail.trim()) ||\n        (typeof parsed?.message === \"string\" && parsed.message.trim()) ||\n        \"\";\n    } catch {\n      detail = \"\";\n    }\n\n    errorMsg =\n      detail ||\n      \"Ingestion failed while processing the request. Please try again.\";\n  }\n} catch (err) {\n  try {\n    console.error(\"Unexpected ingestion error:\", err);\n  } catch {}\n  errorMsg = \"Ingestion failed. Please verify the provided values and try again.\";\n}\n\nreturn errorMsg;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775110562713"
          },
          "code": "FORMAT_ERROR_MESSAGE",
          "id": "1776066136960",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Uses an LLM to determine whether the retrieved SR has sufficient content to ingest.",
            "name": "check SR Validation"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775501376833"
          },
          "code": "CHECK_SR_VALIDATION",
          "id": "1775458382742",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775458382742_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Please validate the retrieved SR using the following criteria:\n\nAn SR is considered valid if **either** of the following conditions is satisfied:\n\n1. **The SR contains log data** (i.e., diagnostic logs, runtime logs, or system data included in any of the SR fields).\n - Check if any field includes raw log data that can be interpreted as diagnostic or runtime logs. If logs are present, the SR is valid.\n\n2. **At least one of the following fields contains clear, specific, and meaningful information**, even if the others are null or incomplete. A field is considered valid if:\n - It provides **specific details** about the issue, is **understandable**, and has **actionable information**.\n - It should **directly relate to the core issue or request**. \n \n The fields to evaluate are:\n - **Title** (`{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SR.$output.items[0].Title}}`) - Must be clear, direct, and meaningful, summarizing the core issue. It should not be vague or overly broad.\n - **ProblemDescription** (`{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SR.$output.items[0].ProblemDescription}}`) - Must provide specific details on the issue or request. It should explain the problem in sufficient detail so the cause is understandable.\n - **ResolveDescription** (`{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SR.$output.items[0].ResolveDescription}}`) - Must outline how the issue was addressed, providing a **complete, clear, and informative solution** or steps taken to resolve the problem. It should not be a generic or overly vague description.\n\nIf none of these conditions are met, the SR is considered **not valid**. Please ensure that you check each of the above fields carefully to verify if the information provided meets the criteria."
            },
            {
              "id": "1775458382742_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Please validate the retrieved SR using the following criteria:\n\nAn SR is considered valid if **either** of the following conditions is satisfied:\n\n1. **The SR contains log data** (i.e., diagnostic logs, runtime logs, or system data included in any of the SR fields).\n - Check if any field includes raw log data that can be interpreted as diagnostic or runtime logs. If logs are present, the SR is valid.\n\n2. **At least one of the following fields contains clear, specific, and meaningful information**, even if the others are null or incomplete. A field is considered valid if:\n - It provides **specific details** about the issue, is **understandable**, and has **actionable information**.\n - It should **directly relate to the core issue or request**. \n \n The fields to evaluate are:\n - **Title** (`{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SR.$output.items[0].Title}}`) - Must be clear, direct, and meaningful, summarizing the core issue. It should not be vague or overly broad.\n - **ProblemDescription** (`{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SR.$output.items[0].ProblemDescription}}`) - Must provide specific details on the issue or request. It should explain the problem in sufficient detail so the cause is understandable.\n - **ResolveDescription** (`{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SR.$output.items[0].ResolveDescription}}`) - Must outline how the issue was addressed, providing a **complete, clear, and informative solution** or steps taken to resolve the problem. It should not be a generic or overly vague description.\n\nIf none of these conditions are met, the SR is considered **not valid**. Please ensure that you check each of the above fields carefully to verify if the information provided meets the criteria."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"Reason\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"valid\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_CX_SERVICECEN_RETRIEVERESOLVE",
            "description": "Retrieves resolved Service Requests matching the provided query (limit/offset) for bulk ingestion.",
            "errorNodeId": "1776066136960",
            "functionName": "getResolvedSRs",
            "name": "Fetch Retrieve Resolved SRs"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775110824602"
          },
          "code": "FETCH_RETRIEVE_RESOLVED_SRS",
          "id": "1775110750542",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775110750542_ObjectType",
              "name": "ObjectType",
